<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Jan oil product stocks--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Jan oil product stocks--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Monday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-January:</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Gasoline	2,097	 13,190     +9.7     -5.2</p>
<p> Naphtha	 1,648	 10,366     -5.1     -7.0</p>
<p> Jet Fuel	  694	  4,365     +3.6     +7.6</p>
<p> Kerosene	3,422	 21,524    -17.0    +30.2</p>
<p> Gas Oil	 2,406	 15,134     +3.0    +25.0</p>
<p> Fuel Oil A    1,680	 10,567     -3.4    +17.4</p>
<p> Fuel Oil B	  4	     25     +0.0    +33.3</p>
<p> Fuel Oil C    2,087	 13,127     +5.6     -6.5</p>
<p> Total	  14,038	 88,299     -3.2     +9.3</p>
<p>(Figures may not tally due to rounding off.)</p>
</text>
